window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The Devil and Her Demon is book two in The Shadows Of Desire Series: A Dark Romance Collection</b></p> <p><b>The Aftermath</b><br> The days following the Warehouse have left everyone hurt and confused. The explanation can only be summarized in one word: <b><i>betrayal.</i></b></p> <p><b>The Mourning</b><br> Nothing could have prepared them for a loss of this magnitude. The only way to survive it is to regain each other's <b><i>trust.</i></b></p> <p><b>The Redemption</b><br> The fight for forgiveness forges on as they navigate their emotions while trying to accomplish the one thing they failed to do: bring Scarlet’s father to <b><i>justice.</i></b></p>"; 
